comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-24T18:52:00.749Z","harness:claude-code","Finished by the orchestrator after the agent's provider login was revoked mid-run. Failure classes on pm-cli 2026.11.24: an array passed to the scalar --base flag is now refused by the host with extension_flag_value_invalid (the package's own nonempty check still refuses a blank value with swarm_input_invalid); host dispatch without repo_root falls back to the tracker workspace (new test for explicit repository and tracker coordinates). All four changelog entry points pass --dependency-updates, with a regression test. Agent-run gates before it stopped: npm release:check passed including all seven packed-install tests; Bun coverage 1,267/1,267 with 100% in all four dimensions. Orchestrator re-checks on the committed tree: typecheck, lint, changelog:check, the changelog-flag test."
